1. validate_image()

Checks whether the uploaded file has an allowed extension.

Allowed:

.jpg

.jpeg

.png

Rejected:

.exe

.zip

.pdf

.sh
2. generate_unique_filename()

Suppose two users upload:

image.jpg

Without a unique filename:

image.jpg

would be overwritten.

Instead, we generate something like:

5a3b7f11-c91e-4a9d-a7d2-5db57e0d0c43.jpg

This guarantees uniqueness.

3. save_upload_file()

This function:

Validates the file.
Generates a unique filename.
Saves it under:
app/uploads/
Returns the generated filename.

